{"blocks": [{"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 0, "page_number": 1, "text": "Slide 1", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 1, "page_number": 1, "text": "Coordinator Application 2026–27", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.is_title_slide": true, "parser.slide.number": 1, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 2, "page_number": 1, "text": "Atharv Patil", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 2, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 3, "page_number": 2, "text": "Slide 2", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "id", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 2, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 4, "page_number": 2, "text": "INTRODUCTION", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 2, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 5, "page_number": 2, "text": "My name is Atharv Patil, a Y24 B.Tech undergraduate in Mechanical Engineering at IIT Kanpur and currently serving as a Secretary in the Fine Arts Club .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 2, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 6, "page_number": 2, "text": "Art, especially pencil sketching , has been a passion of mine since childhood, and it grew stronger during the COVID lockdown when I dedicated more time to practicing and improving my skills. I also appeared for the Intermediate Drawing Grade Examination conducted by the Directorate of Art, Government of Maharashtra , which helped strengthen my artistic foundation.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 2, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 7, "page_number": 2, "text": "After joining IIT Kanpur and discovering the Fine Arts Club , I found an inspiring community where I could further develop my skills and contribute to club activities. Now, I aspire to take on the role of Coordinator , where I can use my experience, leadership and enthusiasm to enhance the club’s initiatives and strengthen its creative community.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 8, "page_number": 3, "text": "Slide 3", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 9, "page_number": 3, "text": "About Me", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 10, "page_number": 3, "text": "Secretary , Fine Arts Club (FAC), IIT Kanpur", "type": "text"}, {"language": "de", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 11, "page_number": 3, "text": "Organizer – IICM 8.0", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 12, "page_number": 3, "text": "Active contributor in Galaxy ’25 & ’26 (Hall 12)", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 13, "page_number": 3, "text": "Performed Speed Painting in Orientation Y25", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 3, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 14, "page_number": 3, "text": "Performed Speed Painting during Freshers’ Night ’24", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 15, "page_number": 4, "text": "Slide 4", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "de", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 16, "page_number": 4, "text": "VISION", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 17, "page_number": 4, "text": "Build a well-organized and vibrant creative environment within the Fine Arts Club that encourages artistic exploration.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 18, "page_number": 4, "text": "Increase student participation in fine arts activities by making events more engaging and accessible to beginners.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 19, "page_number": 4, "text": "Strengthen IIT Kanpur’s performance in competitions such as Inter-IIT, Antaragni , and Galaxy through consistent practice and preparation.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 20, "page_number": 4, "text": "Improve the visibility and documentation of artistic work through a revived and actively maintained FAC website.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 4, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 21, "page_number": 4, "text": "Create a club culture that values creativity, collaboration, and continuous learning in art.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 22, "page_number": 5, "text": "Slide 5", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "sw", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 23, "page_number": 5, "text": "MISSION", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 24, "page_number": 5, "text": "Organize creative workshops and interactive art events such as 3D illusion art, Kintsugi art, wearable art, and sculpture workshops.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 25, "page_number": 5, "text": "Implement a structured system for managing club materials and maintaining the club workspace to ensure an efficient creative environment.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 26, "page_number": 5, "text": "Develop and maintain an active digital presence for the club through a revived FAC website showcasing artworks and events.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 27, "page_number": 5, "text": "Conduct regular practice sessions and mini competitions to identify talented artists and prepare them for Inter-IIT and other competitions.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 5, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 28, "page_number": 5, "text": "Encourage students to explore diverse art forms and creative techniques , helping them refine their artistic skills and confidence.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 29, "page_number": 6, "text": "Slide 6", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 30, "page_number": 6, "text": "Key Initiatives", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 31, "page_number": 6, "text": "Reviving and maintaining the Fine Arts Club Website", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 32, "page_number": 6, "text": "Club Space & Material Management System", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 33, "page_number": 6, "text": "Kintsugi Art – Introduction to Japanese art and philosophy", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 34, "page_number": 6, "text": "3D & Optical Illusion Art Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 35, "page_number": 6, "text": "Ganesha for Everyone", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 36, "page_number": 6, "text": "Wearable Art Night (custom T-shirts / tote bags / glow paint)", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 6, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 37, "page_number": 6, "text": "Inter-IIT Preparation & Practice Program", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 38, "page_number": 7, "text": "Slide 7", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 39, "page_number": 7, "text": "Reviving and maintaining the Fine Arts Club Website", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 40, "page_number": 7, "text": "Currently, multiple FAC-related web pages exist but they are not actively updated or maintained . The existing websites mostly contain static information about the club and past events , with very limited updates about recent activities. This limits the digital visibility of the Fine Arts Club and its artworks . I propose reviving and maintaining a single active FAC website that will serve as a digital hub for the club and since I am familiar with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript , I would be able to actively contribute to developing and maintaining the website.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 41, "page_number": 7, "text": "Features of the Revived Website", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 42, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Online gallery showcasing artworks created by FAC members", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 43, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Regular updates about workshops, exhibitions, and events", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 44, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Profiles of artists and contributors from the club", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 45, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Archive of past events and achievements", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 46, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Integration with social media platforms for wider reach", "type": "text"}, {"language": "ro", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 47, "page_number": 7, "text": "Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 7, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 48, "page_number": 7, "text": "• Improves online presence and recognition of the club • Provides a digital portfolio for student artists • Helps document and preserve FAC’s artistic journey", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 49, "page_number": 8, "text": "Slide 8", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 50, "page_number": 8, "text": "Club Space & Material Management System", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 51, "page_number": 8, "text": "Ensure better organization and management of art materials within the Fine Arts Club. Introduce a structured system for storing materials such as paints, brushes, canvases, and tools. Establishing clear guidelines for material usage and placement after activities. Maintain regular cleanliness and organization of the club workspace .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 52, "page_number": 8, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 53, "page_number": 8, "text": "• Assign designated storage sections for different types of materials.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 54, "page_number": 8, "text": "• Maintain a material inventory record to track available resources.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 55, "page_number": 8, "text": "• Encourage members to follow basic cleanliness and responsibility guidelines .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 56, "page_number": 8, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 57, "page_number": 8, "text": "• Better accessibility and management of club resources", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 58, "page_number": 8, "text": "• A clean and organized creative workspace", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 8, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 59, "page_number": 8, "text": "• Improved efficiency during workshops and events", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 60, "page_number": 9, "text": "Slide 9", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 61, "page_number": 9, "text": "Kintsugi Art – Introduction to Japanese art and philosophy", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 62, "page_number": 9, "text": "Introducing students to Kintsugi , a traditional Japanese art of repairing broken pottery using gold or metallic lacquer . The philosophy of Kintsugi highlights the idea that imperfections and cracks are part of an object's history and beauty . Participants will learn the process of repairing ceramic pieces creatively , transforming broken objects into unique artworks. The workshop will combine art, craftsmanship, and philosophical perspective , making it both creative and meaningful.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 63, "page_number": 9, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 64, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Organize a hands-on workshop session where students repair and decorate broken pottery pieces.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 65, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Provide materials such as ceramic pieces, adhesive, metallic paint or gold powder .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 66, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Display the finished works during club exhibitions or art showcases .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 67, "page_number": 9, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 68, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Introduces students to global art forms and artistic philosophies", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 69, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Encourages creative experimentation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 9, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 70, "page_number": 9, "text": "• Makes the workshop interactive and memorable", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 71, "page_number": 10, "text": "Slide 10", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 72, "page_number": 10, "text": "3D & Optical Illusion Art Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 73, "page_number": 10, "text": "Conduct a workshop introducing students to 3D drawing and optical illusion art techniques . Participants will learn concepts such as perspective, shading, and depth , which create the illusion of three-dimensional objects on a flat surface. The session will focus on creating interactive and visually striking artworks . Students will gain hands-on experience in experimenting with creative visual perception techniques .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 74, "page_number": 10, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 75, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Organize a hands-on workshop session with guided demonstrations external artist or a skilled student.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 76, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Provide materials such as paper, pencils, markers, and rulers .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 77, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Encourage participants to create their own 3D illusion artworks , which can be displayed during club exhibitions.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 78, "page_number": 10, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 79, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Makes fine arts more engaging and accessible for beginners", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 80, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Encourages creative experimentation with visual perception", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 10, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 81, "page_number": 10, "text": "• Attracts higher participation from students interested in modern art styles", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 82, "page_number": 11, "text": "Slide 11", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 83, "page_number": 11, "text": "Ganesha For Everyone", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 84, "page_number": 11, "text": "Organize a workshop where students create eco-friendly Ganesh idols using natural clay . Introduce participants to traditional idol-making techniques and sculpting basics . Encourage the use of sustainable materials instead of plaster of Paris, promoting environmental awareness. Provide students with an opportunity to express creativity through sculpture and cultural art forms .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 85, "page_number": 11, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 86, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Conduct the workshop around the time of Ganesh Chaturthi .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 87, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Provide materials such as natural clay, sculpting tools, and eco-friendly colors .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 88, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Participants can take their idols home or display them during club exhibitions .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 89, "page_number": 11, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 90, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Promotes environmentally responsible artistic practices", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 91, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Encourages hands-on creative learning", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 11, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 92, "page_number": 11, "text": "• Connects art with cultural traditions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 93, "page_number": 12, "text": "Slide 12", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 94, "page_number": 12, "text": "Wearable Art Night", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 95, "page_number": 12, "text": "Organize a creative event where students design and paint their own wearable artworks . Participants can customize items such as T-shirts, tote bags, or jackets using fabric paints and creative designs. Introduce the use of glow-in-the-dark or fluorescent paints to create unique visual effects during the event. Encourage students to experiment with personalized designs, patterns, and artistic expressions.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 96, "page_number": 12, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 97, "page_number": 12, "text": "• Provide basic materials such as fabric paints, brushes, and plain T-shirts or tote bags .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 98, "page_number": 12, "text": "• Participants can either bring their own wearable items or use the materials provided.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 99, "page_number": 12, "text": "• The event can be organized as a fun evening activity with music and collaborative art .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 100, "page_number": 12, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 101, "page_number": 12, "text": "• Encourages high student participation through a fun and interactive activity.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 102, "page_number": 12, "text": "• Promotes creative self-expression through fashion and art .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 12, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 103, "page_number": 12, "text": "• Creates memorable artworks that participants can use and showcase .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 104, "page_number": 13, "text": "Slide 13", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 105, "page_number": 13, "text": "Inter-IIT Preparation & Practice Program", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 106, "page_number": 13, "text": "Conduct regular practice sessions for students interested in representing IIT Kanpur in fine arts competitions. Organize mini art competitions within the club to encourage participation and healthy competition. Use these activities to identify talented artists for Inter-IIT and other competitions . Provide opportunities for students to improve their skills through consistent practice and feedback .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "fr", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 107, "page_number": 13, "text": "Implementation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 108, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Organize monthly internal art challenges or mini competitions .", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 109, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Offer small rewards or recognition to motivate participants.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 110, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Create a pool of talented artists who can represent IIT Kanpur in competitions.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 111, "page_number": 13, "text": "Expected Impact", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 112, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Increased student participation in competitive art activities", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 113, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Better preparation for Inter-IIT competitions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 13, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 114, "page_number": 13, "text": "• Strengthening IIT Kanpur’s performance in Inter-IIT and other competitions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 115, "page_number": 14, "text": "Slide 14", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "vi", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 116, "page_number": 14, "text": "TIMELINE", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 117, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<April>> • Secretary recruitment and orientation of new members • Cleaning and organizing club materials and workspace", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 118, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<May – June>> • Planning of workshops and club activities • Website revival work begins", "type": "text"}, {"language": "cy", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 119, "page_number": 14, "text": "• Y22 Farewell", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 120, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<July>> • Orientation preparation and speed art performance • Introduction session for new students about FAC", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 121, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<August>> • 3D & Optical Illusion Art Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 122, "page_number": 14, "text": "• Freshers’ Night", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 123, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<September>> • Eco-Friendly Ganesh Idol Making Workshop (Ganesha for Everyone) • Initial practice sessions for Inter-IIT competitions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 124, "page_number": 14, "text": "<<October>> • Preparation and artwork creation for Antaragni events and exhibitions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 14, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 125, "page_number": 14, "text": "• Mini art competitions within the club", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 126, "page_number": 15, "text": "Slide 15", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "vi", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 127, "page_number": 15, "text": "TIMELINE", "type": "text"}, {"language": "no", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 128, "page_number": 15, "text": "<<November>>", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 129, "page_number": 15, "text": "• Diwali • Regular practice sessions for Inter-IIT and Audition", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 130, "page_number": 15, "text": "<<December>> • Inter-IIT Cultural Meet (IICM) practice and participation", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 131, "page_number": 15, "text": "• Post-competition review and feedback session", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 132, "page_number": 15, "text": "<<January>> • Wearable Art Night", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 133, "page_number": 15, "text": "• Galaxy competitions", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 134, "page_number": 15, "text": "<<February>> • Art Fest", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 135, "page_number": 15, "text": "<<March>> • Kintsugi Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 15, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 136, "page_number": 15, "text": "• Review of activities and documentation for club archive • Y25 Coordinator Interview", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 137, "page_number": 16, "text": "Slide 16", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 138, "page_number": 16, "text": "Budget Breakdown for Planned Activities", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 139, "page_number": 16, "text": "Event / Activity", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 140, "page_number": 16, "text": "Estimated Cost", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 141, "page_number": 16, "text": "Y22 Farewell (art gifts, materials, decoration)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 142, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹2000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 143, "page_number": 16, "text": "Orientation (speed art, colors, charts, logistics)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 144, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹5000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 145, "page_number": 16, "text": "3D & Optical Illusion Art Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 146, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹2500", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 147, "page_number": 16, "text": "Freshers' Night (art materials, props, painting)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 148, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹5000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 149, "page_number": 16, "text": "Eco-Friendly Ganesh Idol Workshop", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 150, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹6000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 151, "page_number": 16, "text": "Mini Art Competitions (prizes & materials)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 152, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹2500", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 153, "page_number": 16, "text": "Diwali Art Activities (rangoli colors, diyas, paints)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 154, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹3000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 155, "page_number": 16, "text": "Kintsugi Workshop (ceramics, metallic paint, adhesives)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 16, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 156, "page_number": 16, "text": "₹8000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 157, "page_number": 17, "text": "Slide 17", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 158, "page_number": 17, "text": "Budget Breakdown for Planned Activities", "type": "text"}, {"language": "ro", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 159, "page_number": 17, "text": "Total Expenditure ≈ ₹91,000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 160, "page_number": 17, "text": "Event / Activity", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 161, "page_number": 17, "text": "Estimated Cost", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 162, "page_number": 17, "text": "Preparation & Artwork for Antaragni", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 163, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹6000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 164, "page_number": 17, "text": "Inter-IIT Practice Materials", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 165, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹7000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 166, "page_number": 17, "text": "Wearable Art Night (fabric paints, brushes, supplies)", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 167, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹6000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 168, "page_number": 17, "text": "Galaxy Competition *", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 169, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹3000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "de", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 170, "page_number": 17, "text": "Art Fest", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 171, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹30000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 172, "page_number": 17, "text": "Miscellaneous / Contingency", "type": "text"}, {"language": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 17, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 173, "page_number": 17, "text": "₹5000", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 174, "page_number": 18, "text": "Slide 18", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "ro", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 175, "page_number": 18, "text": "Team Structure", "type": "text"}, {"language": "it", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 176, "page_number": 18, "text": "Coordinators", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 177, "page_number": 18, "text": "The Fine Arts Club will be led by four coordinators who will collectively oversee the functioning of the club. They will be responsible for planning events, organizing workshops, coordinating participation in competitions such as Antaragni and Inter-IIT, and ensuring smooth communication between members of the club and the MnC Council. Coordinators will also guide secretaries and make key decisions regarding the club’s activities and initiatives.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "ro", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 178, "page_number": 18, "text": "Secretaries", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 179, "page_number": 18, "text": "The club will consist of around 20–25 secretaries , selected based on their artistic abilities, enthusiasm, communication skills, didgital art and ability, and commitment to the club. Secretaries will play an active role in executing events, assisting in workshops, managing logistics, and contributing creatively to club projects. They will also help in organizing competitions and encouraging wider student participation in the club’s activities.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 180, "page_number": 18, "text": "Ex-Coordinators and Ex-Secretaries", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 18, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 181, "page_number": 18, "text": "The experience and guidance of ex-coordinators and ex-secretaries will remain valuable for the club. Their insights and mentorship can help current members improve event planning, artistic quality, and competition preparation. Seeking advice from alumni members of the club can also help maintain continuity and strengthen the overall growth of the Fine Arts Club.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 19, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 182, "page_number": 19, "text": "Slide 19", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 19, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 183, "page_number": 19, "text": "Past Experience & Credentials", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 19, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 184, "page_number": 19, "text": "During my time as a Secretary in the Fine Arts Club , I have actively contributed to several club activities and events. I participated in organizing and supporting artistic events, which helped me understand the planning and execution involved in managing club activities.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 19, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 185, "page_number": 19, "text": "I have also been involved in events such as Orientation performances and Freshers’ Night , where I contributed through artistic work and event coordination. Additionally, I have participated in Galaxy competitions representing Hall 12 , which gave me valuable exposure to competitive artistic events within the institute.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 19, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 186, "page_number": 19, "text": "Apart from these activities, I also worked as an Organizer in IICM 8.0 , which provided experience in managing responsibilities, coordinating with team members, and contributing effectively to a larger event. These experiences have helped me develop skills in teamwork, event organization, creative problem solving, and leadership , which I believe will help me contribute effectively as a coordinator of the Fine Arts Club.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 20, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 187, "page_number": 20, "text": "Slide 20", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 20, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 188, "page_number": 20, "text": "Views on the Previous Tenure", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 20, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 189, "page_number": 20, "text": "During my time as a secretary in the Fine Arts Club, I had the opportunity to closely observe the functioning of the club and learn from the efforts of the previous coordinators and secretaries. The previous tenure successfully organized several events and provided opportunities for students to showcase their creativity through activities such as Antaragni , Galaxy, and other club events.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 20, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 190, "page_number": 20, "text": "Through this experience, I also noticed a few areas where the club can further improve. For instance, better organization of club materials and workspace can help maintain a more efficient and clean creative environment. Additionally, introducing more regular practice sessions and internal competitions can help identify talented artists early and strengthen preparation for competitions such as Inter-IIT.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 20, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 191, "page_number": 20, "text": "Overall, my experience in the previous tenure has helped me understand both the strengths of the club and the areas where further improvements can be made. As a coordinator, I would aim to build upon these experiences and contribute towards making the Fine Arts Club more organized, active, and engaging for all members.", "type": "text"}, {"language": "es", "level": 1, "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 21, "parser.slide.role": "title"}, "ordinal": 192, "page_number": 21, "text": "Slide 21", "type": "heading"}, {"language": "en", "metadata": {"parser.slide.number": 21, "parser.slide.role": "body"}, "ordinal": 193, "page_number": 21, "text": "THANK YOU !", "type": "text"}], "doc_type": "slides", "language": "en", "metadata": {"authors": [], "content_hash": "657eb7989863eb6acdf2555158f6c4f5affead5cdc9a4297fde44971da2e9064", "doi": null, "isbn": null, "metadata": {"parser.slide.schema_version": 1, "slides_count": 21, "title": "Coordinator Application 2026–27"}, "page_count": null, "publication_date": null, "title": "Coordinator Application 2026–27", "url": null}, "model": "parsed_document", "schema_version": 1}